# RFC-004 - Knowledge Engine API Specification (V1)

## Background

We have completed the following architecture:

- Canonical Knowledge Model
- PostgreSQL + pgvector schema
- Repository Analyzer
- Ingestion Pipeline
- Retrieval & Context Engine

Do NOT redesign any existing architecture.

The purpose of this RFC is to define the public API exposed by the Knowledge Engine.

The Knowledge Engine is a deterministic component.

It does NOT call an LLM.

It is responsible for:

- SQL retrieval
- Vector retrieval
- Hybrid retrieval
- Relationship traversal
- Context enrichment
- Ranking
- Context assembly

It returns structured Knowledge Context objects.

The AI Worker performs reasoning.

